================================================================================
                           PROJECT DESCRIPTION
================================================================================

This repository contains payloads designed for the WiFi Pineapple Pager, a
portable penetration testing device. These payloads enable security
professionals to conduct authorized assessments of wireless networks and
connected systems.

The WiFi Pineapple Pager Payloads collection includes:
  - Reconnaissance and enumeration scripts
  - Network analysis tools
  - Exfiltration demonstrations
  - Automation utilities
  - Educational examples


