limited to:

  - All payload scripts and source code
  - Configuration files and templates
  - Documentation and README files
  - Shell scripts and automation tools
  - Supporting libraries developed for this project
  - ASCII art and branding assets

Third-party components included in this repository may be subject to their
own licensing terms. Where applicable, individual payload directories may
contain their own LICENSE files that govern those specific components.


